        medium: "Reveals lowest cards first. Can recognize simple 'representational' bluffs.",
        hard: "Models opponent hand based on reveal choice (Game Theory Optimal reveal). Calculates equity for the Dakota 'Option' purchase.",
      },
      considerations: [
        'Hidden state modeling: 5 cards known to self, 2 unknown to opponents.',
        'Wild card logic (Dakota variant).',
        'Simultaneous reveal sync.',
      ],
