        history: {
          origins: "Developed as a home-game enhancement to Seven-Card Stud. It gained popularity in rural American poker circles (like North/South Dakota, giving rise to the 'Dakota' variant) for adding a 'choice' element to the otherwise fixed Stud deal.",
          originCountries: [
